{# Mistral model template.

Extends the base template with Mistral-specific formatting.
Mistral Large models are known for their strong instruction following
and structured output generation capabilities.

Mistral models currently don't support extended thinking/reasoning mode,
so the reasoning_instructions block is simplified.
#}
{% extends "base.jinja2" %}

{# Mistral uses the standard system prompt #}
{% block system_intro %}
{{ system_prompt }}
{% endblock %}

{# Mistral doesn't support extended reasoning mode #}
{% block reasoning_instructions %}
{% if supports_reasoning %}

## Thinking Process

When working through complex problems:
- Analyze the request carefully before taking action
- Consider the most efficient approach
- Validate your reasoning before responding
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{# Mistral excels at structured tool usage #}
{% block tool_instructions %}
{% if tools %}

## Available Tools

You have access to the following tools for computational chemistry tasks:
{% for tool in tools %}
- **{{ tool.function.name }}**: {{ tool.function.description }}
{% endfor %}

Call tools using the function calling API when needed. Always use exact reference IDs from previous tool outputs - never invent or guess IDs.
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{# Mistral-specific behavioral tuning #}
{% block model_specific %}

## Response Guidelines

- Be direct and precise in your responses
- Use proper scientific notation and units
- Structure complex information clearly
- When uncertain about inputs, ask for clarification
{% endblock %}
